DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
18009::$$$message_0136_0000_0000$$$::After a long trek, I finally arrive at the forest outside of town.[lr]::
18010::$$$message_0136_0000_0001$$$::It should take me about two more hours from here to reach the Einzbern Castle. I'm starting to become familiar with that place.[lr]::
18011::$$$message_0136_0000_0002$$$::Something...tremendous is blocking the entrance to the forest.::
18012::$$$message_0136_0001_0000$$$::"...Hello? Can I ask what you're doing here?"[lr]::
18013::$$$message_0136_0001_0001$$$::"[wacky len=3]..."[lr]::
18014::$$$message_0136_0001_0002$$$::He doesn't answer.[lr]::
18015::$$$message_0136_0001_0003$$$::I can't even tell if that's a yes or a no.::
18016::$$$message_0136_0002_0000$$$::"...Are you standing guard? [wm canskip=0][wdash canskip=0][cacheimage storage=バーサーカー01a(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][dash textoff=0 hidefg=0 mx=740 opacity=255 layer=base irot=-0.0 cx=21 imag=1.3 time=1500 cy=300 mag=1.3 my=0 storage=oアインツ森入り口-(朝靄) rot=-0.0 accel=0][movefg opacity=255 textoff=0 left=-227 top=0 time=1500 accel=0 storage=バーサーカー01a(近)]...Do you mind if I go into the forest? I need to see Illya."[lr]::
18017::$$$message_0136_0002_0001$$$::"[wacky len=3]..."[lr]::
18018::$$$message_0136_0002_0002$$$::He doesn't answer.[lr]::
18019::$$$message_0136_0002_0003$$$::He doesn't even grunt or shake his head.::
18020::$$$message_0136_0003_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
18021::$$$message_0136_0003_0001$$$::"[wacky len=3]..."[lr]::
18022::$$$message_0136_0003_0002$$$::...If he isn't saying anything, that means I can go ahead, right?[lr]::
18023::$$$message_0136_0003_0003$$$::We've seen each other before, so Berserker probably knows who I am.::
18024::$$$message_0136_0004_0000$$$::"Okay. Just passing through, then..."[lr]::
18025::$$$message_0136_0004_0001$$$::I raise a hand and walk past him...::
18026::$$$message_0136_0005_0000$$$::"[wacky len=6]...!!!"[lr]::
18027::$$$message_0136_0005_0001$$$::"Eeeeeeek!?"[lr]::
18028::$$$message_0136_0005_0002$$$::The monster roars,[lr]::
18029::$$$message_0136_0005_0003$$$::the sheer force of his voice declaring that he'll hurl me back into Miyama if I take another step.::
18030::$$$message_0136_0006_0000$$$::"I-i-i-i-is that a problem, sir? Are you telling me to leave for today!?"[lr]::
18031::$$$message_0136_0006_0001$$$::"[wacky len=9]...!"[lr]::
18032::$$$message_0136_0006_0002$$$::The greater B-B-B-Berserker starts to rage even more.[lr]::
18033::$$$message_0136_0006_0003$$$::I have no idea what he's trying to say! Someone please interpret!::
18034::$$$message_0136_0007_0000$$$::"Not the most perceptive guest, are you?[lr]::
18035::$$$message_0136_0007_0001$$$::You showed up on a lady's doorstep without an appointment. Did you expect a warm welcome[line len=2]oh.[lr]::
18036::$$$message_0136_0007_0002$$$::Is that you, Shirou?"::
18037::$$$message_0136_0008_0000$$$::"Illya...?"[lr]::
18038::$$$message_0136_0008_0001$$$::"Yeah! Hi, Big Brother! I don't see you here very often!"[lr]::
18039::$$$message_0136_0008_0002$$$::Illya waves cheerfully at me.[lr]::
18040::$$$message_0136_0008_0003$$$::But she doesn't step out of the forest, for some reason.::
18041::$$$message_0136_0009_0000$$$::"Heeey, Illya![lr]::
18042::$$$message_0136_0009_0001$$$::I want to go hang out at the castle! Can you tell Berserker to let me through!?"::
18043::$$$message_0136_0010_0000$$$::"Oh. So you came to look at the castle, not me.[lr]::
18044::$$$message_0136_0010_0001$$$::Then no. [cacheimage storage=イリヤコート01c(遠)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=イリヤコート01c(遠)]My house is undergoing renovations to add a second building and we aren't taking any visitors at this time. You don't know how a girl feels, so please go back to your town."::
18045::$$$message_0136_0011_0000$$$::"Bye," waves Illya.[lr]::
18046::$$$message_0136_0011_0001$$$::Even if I tried to stop her, an impassable wall of muscle blocks my path.[wm canskip=0]::
18047::$$$message_0136_0012_0000$$$::"Now hold on.[lr]::
18048::$$$message_0136_0012_0001$$$::I think wanting to go to the castle is the same as wanting to see you."[lr]::
18049::$$$message_0136_0012_0002$$$::I stick to the facts.[lr]::
18050::$$$message_0136_0012_0003$$$::Even I know how to consider a girl's feelings.::
18051::$$$message_0136_0013_0000$$$::"...That's pretty smooth for you, but no.[lr]::
18052::$$$message_0136_0013_0001$$$::There's nothing to do at my castle. There's nothing you'd enjoy there, and there aren't any clues to the Holy Grail War, either.[lr]::
18053::$$$message_0136_0013_0002$$$::If you're trying to dig anything up on me, it would be more productive to just walk around town."::
18054::$$$message_0136_0014_0000$$$::"That's not true. I think your castle's an interesting place."[lr]::
18055::$$$message_0136_0014_0001$$$::It's incredible inside, I can always see Illya there, and Sella and Leys are there, too.[lr]::
18056::$$$message_0136_0014_0002$$$::There might even be clues about the Holy Grail War there, if I look.[lr]::
18057::$$$message_0136_0014_0003$$$::Illya's a Master, too.[lr]::
18058::$$$message_0136_0014_0004$$$::Even if there's nothing in her castle, Illya could be in some trouble.::
18059::$$$message_0136_0015_0000$$$::"...Oh, I can tell what you're thinking. It's written all over your face.[lr]::
18060::$$$message_0136_0015_0001$$$::I don't really want you to come...but I know you'd keep trying even if I said no."::
18061::$$$message_0136_0016_0000$$$::"Okay. If you insist, then I'll think about it.[lr]::
18062::$$$message_0136_0016_0001$$$::You'll probably come back even if I chase you off.[lr]::
18063::$$$message_0136_0016_0002$$$::So I'll throw you a slightly odd welcoming party."::
18064::$$$message_0136_0017_0000$$$::Her somber expression suddenly changes into a bewitching grin.[lr]::
18065::$$$message_0136_0017_0001$$$::...That's the face of an imp plotting some exceptional mischief.::
18066::$$$message_0136_0018_0000$$$::"Heeeey, Illya?[lr]::
18067::$$$message_0136_0018_0001$$$::You didn't just think of an awful prank, did you?"[lr]::
18068::$$$message_0136_0018_0002$$$::I think it's admirable of her to welcome a guest, no need to get bogged down in the details.::
18069::$$$message_0136_0019_0000$$$::"Well, if you're coming, I need to hurry up and get ready.[lr]::
18070::$$$message_0136_0019_0001$$$::I need to clear the forest, build a wall, get a bunch of chariots ready to receive you...[cacheimage storage=イリヤコート08g(遠)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=イリヤコート08g(遠)] And oh, I wouldn't be a very good mistress if I didn't give Sella and Leys a chance to shine."[lr]::
18071::$$$message_0136_0019_0002$$$::She isn't listening.::
18072::$$$message_0136_0020_0000$$$::I can hear Illya's Magic Circuits whirring at maximum rotation.[lr]::
18073::$$$message_0136_0020_0001$$$::...From what I've heard, Illya's magecraft can skip over theory and produce concrete results.[lr]::
18074::$$$message_0136_0020_0002$$$::Maybe it's because she's a miniature Holy Grail. Whatever Illya wants to do or wishes for will come true as long as it's within the limits of her magical energy, whether she knows the specific method to accomplish it or not, or so I'm told.::
18075::$$$message_0136_0021_0000$$$::"...I think we need a moat, too. Can't exactly call it storming the castle otherwise.[lr]::
18076::$$$message_0136_0021_0001$$$::As for a maze... Hmm, I might not have enough magical energy for that."[lr]::
18077::$$$message_0136_0021_0002$$$::Something that can't be undone is unfolding at a frenetic pace before my eyes.[lr]::
18078::$$$message_0136_0021_0003$$$::Argh, she's using the wish-granting power of the Holy Grail for the silliest reasons...::
18079::$$$message_0136_0022_0000$$$::"Um, Illya? I just want to visit the castle."[lr]::
18080::$$$message_0136_0022_0001$$$::"Yes, and I'll send you an invitation once I'm ready. Just keep enjoying your peace and quiet in the meantime.[lr]::
18081::$$$message_0136_0022_0002$$$::...Hehe. I hope you're ready. Once it's ready, I'll give you so much to enjoy that you'll be the one asking [font italic=true]me[font italic=false] whether I've had enough."[wvs][clfg textoff=0 storage=イリヤコート06a(遠) rule=シャッター左から time=400]::
18082::$$$message_0136_0023_0000$$$::Illya disappears into the mist, leaving me with a death sentence.[lr]::
18083::$$$message_0136_0023_0001$$$::"That does not sound good for my health..."[lr]::
18084::$$$message_0136_0023_0002$$$::It's starting to sound like I'll have to endure some terrifying trials to even reach the Einzbern Castle.::
18085::$$$message_0136_0024_0000$$$::The giant stands there silently.[lr]::
18086::$$$message_0136_0024_0001$$$::Somehow, I sense that he's encouraging me with a "don't lose heart, lad."::
918043::$$$message_9136_0010_0000$$$::"Oh. So you came to look at the castle, not me."[r]L��